{
  "notes": [
    "The V2 confirmation signs the nine-field TaskDataObjectRefV1 projection.",
    "Non-evidence INPUT and OUTPUT use UNSPECIFIED evidence kind; each evidence bundle uses its typed kind.",
    "The Builder service signature is excluded from its own H_FIELDS preimage.",
    "Worker evidence has two bundles per round, so the Worker A-level (WORKER_TOKEN_OPENING) and B-level (WORKER_VALUE_OPENING) manifests are confirmed as separate objects.",
    "The two Worker evidence confirmations name the published A-level and B-level objects: content_hash is the typed commitment in infer_receipt_v3.json, size_bytes the manifest length and artifact_total_size_bytes the sum of its artifact sizes in canonical_json_v1.json."
  ],
  "schema": "trueopen.task.builder_confirmation.v1",
